        {
          "kicker": "Eligibility watch",
          "heading": "Mark Nawaqanitawase weighing switch of allegiance from Wallabies to Fiji",
          "body": "Mark Nawaqanitawase has not yet confirmed his international allegiance, and reports now have his Wallabies future in doubt as he considers a switch to Fiji. Sir Steve Hansen said in October that \"Mark Nawaqanitawase would be better off playing for Fiji\", while Wallabies boss Les Kiss has stayed coy about what was discussed with the player. The matter stays open until Nawaqanitawase confirms his allegiance or plays a Test for either side."
        },
