      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Injury blow",
          "heading": "Alex Mitchell ruled out of England's November Nations Championship with hamstring injury",
          "body": "The hamstring injury Mitchell suffered in Northampton's win over Gloucester last weekend also rules him out of the finals weekend later this month. Jack van Poortvliet is likely to start at nine against the Wallabies. Fin Smith, the flyhalf, has a calf problem and took part in limited training on Tuesday; Borthwick has given him until Wednesday to prove he can play, with George Ford and Marcus Smith on standby."
        },
