    "387": {
      "date": "2026-11-04",
      "edition": "Wednesday 4 November",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Club front row",
          "heading": "Clermont add All Blacks prop Ofa Tu'ungafasi as three-month front-row cover",
          "body": "The Top 14 club announced on Tuesday that the 34-year-old has joined on a short-term deal. Their front row is already stretched: Cristian Ojovan and Sacha Lotrian are injured, and scrum anchor Regis Montagne is away with France this month. Tu'ungafasi can play tighthead or loosehead, and he played the last of his 68 Tests in November 2024 and featured for the Blues in this year's Super Rugby. Clermont, ninth in the Top 14, head to leaders Toulouse on Saturday."
        },
