    "388": {
      "date": "2026-11-04",
      "edition": "Wednesday 4 November",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Player focus",
          "heading": "Ulster wing Rob Baloucoune wants first try of season against Argentina",
          "body": "Baloucoune hasn't scored a try yet this season, and the Ulster wing wants that to change when Argentina visit Aviva Stadium. He has played little so far, and this week's game will be his fourth of the campaign, but he is the kind of player who wants his name on the scoresheet. \"Every time I'm on the pitch, I want to score,\" he says. The 29-year-old scored 12 tries in 13 appearances for Ulster, Ireland and Ireland A last season."
        },
        {
