          "kicker": "Coaching profile",
          "heading": "Cheika says Contepomi came into coaching 'raw' before Pumas job",
          "body": "Michael Cheika, who coached Felipe Contepomi at Leinster two decades ago, says his former fly-half came into coaching raw and had to learn the trade properly. Contepomi later spent four seasons as Leinster's attack coach before Cheika brought him into the Pumas set-up. Joe Schmidt, who coached Australia against Argentina in 2024 and 2025, calls him a 'pretty good friend', and the pair each won two of those four Rugby Championship meetings."
