          "heading": "Les Kiss adds Kurtley Beale to Wallabies spring tour squad",
          "body": "Hunter Paisami's personal withdrawal opened the door for Kurtley Beale, 37, who returns to the Wallabies' spring tour after five years away from Test rugby. Beale has 95 caps and comes in after back-to-back Bledisloe Cup defeats to New Zealand. Kiss insists the recall is about depth at flyhalf, where he still has to settle on a World Cup starter. \"He’s in there to perform.\" He will reassess the position after the next Super Rugby Pacific season."
