          "body": "The WRU has added Under 18s tickets in the middle and upper tiers, with thousands of supporters expected in Cardiff for Japan's visit. Cheaper entry remains available: £16 for under-18s accompanying an adult, £22 for students and adults from £31. Fan Zone Cymru opens at Cardiff Arms Park with free entry, and a junior tag festival runs alongside it for players from 25 community clubs."
